		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Other Chupathingy players in your games learn\nwhich profile you are, and see you by its name."/>
		<string text="Report the games you join, so they show on your\nrecord. Off: only hosts that report have them."/>
		<string text="Games you host are reported to the site. Off:\nthey aren't, even while listed."/>
		<string text="As host, send the game's events (kills, weapons,\nmedals) for Delta Stats."/>
		<string text="Saved on the site: hides your record from everyone\nelse. You still see it here and on the site."/>
		<string text="Saved on the site: hides your heatmaps from\neveryone else."/>
		<string text="What Discord shows of your game (as Network\nSetup's)."/>
		<string text="On the scoreboard and in the lobby, players who\nshare their profile show by its name."/>
